vsock-bare-resume

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Vmm::resume_vm kicks every virtio device, and in 1.16.1 the vsock kick sets pending_event_ack at once, so after a bare pause and resume no host-initiated connection reaches the guest, which never acknowledges a TRANSPORT_RESET. The patch keeps the vsock RX open and leaves the snapshot format as 1.16.1 wrote it.
Upstream-Status: merged: upstream pull request 6100 and its 1.16 backport 6182, released in 1.16.2 with a snapshot format change
Drop-When: The build moves to a Firecracker release with pull request 6100.
